            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-P8391 Decorative Oval Traditional Door Pull 3\" Wide x 11\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional Oval style plate with pull handle comes complete with matching finish mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <b><a href=\"/products/traditional-oval-solid-brass-door-push-plate-brass-accents-a07-p8390\">Oval Traditional Door Push Plate</a></b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for BrassAccents A07-P8391 Decorative Traditional Oval Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>\r\n** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/push-pull-plates\">Door Pull Plates</a>. \r\n</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
